  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Vocational Literacy Program for Poverty Reduction (VOLIP)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims at helping reduce poverty, particularly among rural youth and women by (i) equipping them with relevant functional literacy competencies and basic livelihood skills; and (ii) giving them access to micro_finance schemes to enable them improve their livelihoods.</narrative>
